 data-lightbox-sbi=""
 data-title="Today marks our 6th Annual Lakes Band Festival!&lt;br&gt;
Here, Dr. Jonathan Laflamme, Director of Bands at CLC, hosts an educational clinic with the Crosby-Ironton Symphonic Band. All featured bands will come together to perform tonight at 7 p.m. on Friday, Nov. 13 at the Gichi-ziibi Center for the Arts in Brainerd. Admission is free and open to the public. Entire families are encouraged to attend.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
Featured ensembles include:&lt;br&gt;
