Here, Dr. Jonathan Laflamme, Director of Bands at CLC, hosts an educational clinic with the Crosby-Ironton Symphonic Band. All featured bands will come together to perform tonight at 7 p.m. on Friday, Nov. 13 at the Gichi-ziibi Center for the Arts in Brainerd. Admission is free and open to the public. Entire families are encouraged to attend.  Featured ensembles include:
· Crosby-Ironton Symphonic Band
· Long Prairie-Grey Eagle Symphonic Band
· Milaca High School Symphonic Band
· Brainerd High School Wind Symphony
· Central Lakes College Wind Symphony"> </a></div><div class="sbi_info_wrapper"><div class="sbi_info "><div class="sbi_meta_wrap"></div></div></div></div><div class="sbi-divider"></div></div><div class="sbi_item sbi_type_video sbi_new sbi_transition" role="listitem"	 id="sbi_18038757773851329" data-date="1794603036"
